    <p class="para lt-chem-349426"><em>E</em> = 112.3 kJ, &Delta;<em>T</em> = 0.3893&deg;C, over ten times more light is needed for a 4.0&deg;C increase in temperature</p>
    </div>
    </li>
    <li class="qandaentry lt-chem-349426" id="av_1.0-ch02_s04_s03_qs02_qd01_qa02_ans">
    
    </li>
    <li class="qandaentry lt-chem-349426" id="av_1.0-ch02_s04_s03_qs02_qd01_qa03_ans">
    <div class="answer">
    <p class="para lt-chem-349426">1.7 &times; 10<sup>&minus;35</sup> m, uncertainty in position is &ge; 1.4 &times; 10<sup>&minus;34</sup> m</p>
    </div>
    </li>
    <li class="qandaentry lt-chem-349426" id="av_1.0-ch02_s04_s03_qs02_qd01_qa04_ans">
    
    </li>
